{"hw":"χαριεντίζομαι","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">χαριεντίζομαι</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">χαριεντ-ίζομαι</span>, <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">to be witty, jest,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Ar.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Fr.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">166</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">R.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">436d</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">σπουδῇ χ.</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">to jest</b> in earnest, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ap.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">24c</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">χ. ἐν οὐ χαρίεντι καιρῷ</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">D.H.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Lys.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">14</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">13</span> </span>.—Late in <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Act.</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Procop.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Arc.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">9</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">2</span> <span class=\"gk\">χ. ἐξ ἀναφορᾶς</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">make a charming use of</b>.. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Demetr.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Eloc.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">141</span> </span>.</div></div>"}